{"title":"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The feet of the angle bisectors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b6d5d23a7e91fb9f6c248fb4cd43111165540f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta ABC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> form a right-angled triangle. If the right-angle is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d857b2c804701b561a5c8c90c400f360d27232c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AX$\" width=\"29\" height=\"13\" /> is the bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1ac662f7ddbbce489953c8b7693848239564aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" />, find all possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1ac662f7ddbbce489953c8b7693848239564aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let two new segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a8b5db9ff00c554cedc81b37d6c23b268ce29f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> intersect at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d29465728e92952374a857beaee91665d8dbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> .Consider quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/4/7a44cbe0f1c0dcf92c7e963b5b0bc5139cc595d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AFDC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. Then we get that the cross ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf5fd4d9bf5ec0bcfe4ba07a21ab3eae6616abac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B,Y;X,E)=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />.Thus the condition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0dae690b2bc5493412bdaedcc848606bdfbc111.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FDE=90°$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/3709feef5d8d7a87fe553a8b60f29950a49c95a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FDA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />=<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c07299ad0d41efa0da7b7227d5982389ddd303c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FDB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. Hence F is the A-excenter of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840cb55c82434b9ae047760636a017e9441e6ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Thus we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b7df6c730ead2a41d999452bc683864e3f5000c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle TAF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />=<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f5683a9319dc28877c899dc18725403326d2b7a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />=<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd7ff236155948285f42c13fc857fcae000db48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />, where  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a8b5db9ff00c554cedc81b37d6c23b268ce29f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.Then we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/4940c81559a0816d3ef47635a55fb1f0390d5dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC=120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"112\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO\" title=\"1987 USAMO\">1987 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\